  "data_abstract": "CERN-LHC. The transverse structure of jets was studied via jet fragmentation transverse momentum ($j_{\\rm T}$) distributions, obtained using two-particle correlations in proton-proton and proton-lead collisions, measured with the ALICE experiment at the LHC. The highest transverse momentum particle in each event is used as the trigger particle and the region $3 < p_{\\rm T} < 15$ ~GeV/$c$ is explored in this study.",
